{"full":"hf:notshakti/wraith-env","spaceId":"notshakti/wraith-env","name":"WRAITH Environment","source":"huggingface","description":"An interactive AI application on Hugging Face Spaces.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":null,"topics":["docker","region:us"],"technologies":[],"likes":6,"created":"2026-04-23T10:55:11.000Z","updated":"2026-04-27T08:36:04.000Z","license":null,"runtime":"SLEEPING","appUrl":"https://notshakti-wraith-env.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/notshakti/wraith-env","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T15:47:37.727Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T15:47:37.727Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T15:47:37.727Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"👻","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["OpenEnv Hackathon India 2026 · Boss AI that studies your movement patterns and exploits them in real time.","Most game bosses follow fixed scripts. WRAITH is different — it watches you play, builds a behavioral profile, and picks attacks that specifically counter your dodge habits.","The boss is powered by a Qwen2.5-1.5B LLM fine-tuned with GRPO (Group Relative Policy Optimization). It receives a natural-language behavioral profile of the player and reasons its way to the best combo — no hardcoded heuristics."],"features":["Dodge left too often? WRAITH sweeps left.","Spam attacks? WRAITH baits and punishes.","Start panicking? WRAITH escalates immediately."],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/notshakti/wraith-env/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"1cc5d3c945c912c28778617579f2a7b746ab5b673726b1b24b6b6f56bd9b375a","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T13:56:09.231Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T15:47:37.790Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"OpenEnv Hackathon India 2026 · Boss AI that studies your movement patterns and exploits them in real time.","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/notshakti/wraith-env/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"1cc5d3